cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "WCC4SM: Wavelength Characterization and Calibration for Spectrometer"
authors:
  - family-names: Feng
    given-names: Zheng
    email: feng1214@126.com
version: 1.1
date-released: 2026-09-15
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/feng08321/WCC4SM"
abstract: >-
  WCC4SM is a MATLAB application for spectrum preprocessing, peak
  characterization, reference-line matching, wavelength calibration,
  model validation, calibrated performance analysis, and complete
  analysis-session restoration, developed to support array-spectrometer
  wavelength-calibration research.
keywords:
  - wavelength calibration
  - spectrometer
  - peak characterization
  - reference-line matching
  - MATLAB
